    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a rolling boil. Cook bow tie pasta at a boil until tender yet firm to the bite, about 12 minutes; drain. Quickly rinse the cooked pasta in cold water to stop it from continuing to cook; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1sG22DUHcHqI-YCrqmRU55DyvdA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/3231-bow-tie-pasta-salad-DDMFS-Step-02-2903-bfe51555450a468ba00fae982e797c2f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220413/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cooled pasta, broccoli, tomatoes, sliced green onions, celery, red bell pepper, and green bell pepper in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UlgrqBg7_dapgJFZNencQEBA2lg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/3231-bow-tie-pasta-salad-DDMFS-Step-03-2904-c28efe233b6848a399aa4495a6a6ee98.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220413/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently stir salad dressing and Parmesan cheese together in a bowl until evenly mixed; season to taste with sugar, basil, and salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rjumC3UouUu9ZVEfE7hlhm7bjUY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/3231-bow-tie-pasta-salad-DDMFS-Step-04-2905-bfddbfb15f9447d3be2d719682d6dfe7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220413/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour salad dressing mixture over pasta mixture; gently toss to coat evenly.",
